<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1694849136"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:50.587"><div begin="20.722" end="48.795" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.722" end="26.910" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.722" end="21.912">时间</span><span begin="21.912" end="22.270">静</span><span begin="22.270" end="23.835">止了</span><span begin="24.280" end="25.405">身边</span><span begin="25.405" end="25.791">没</span><span begin="25.791" end="26.910">人</span></p><p begin="27.879" end="34.065" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.879" end="28.975">如果</span><span begin="28.975" end="29.324">爱</span><span begin="29.324" end="30.794">停了</span><span begin="31.422" end="32.503">谁会</span><span begin="32.503" end="32.853">留</span><span begin="32.853" end="34.065">着</span></p><p begin="34.959" end="40.913" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.959" end="35.525">你</span><span begin="35.525" end="36.344">不说</span><span begin="36.344" end="37.695">理由</span><span begin="38.124" end="39.326">也不做</span><span begin="39.326" end="39.711">选</span><span begin="39.711" end="40.913">择</span></p><p begin="41.613" end="48.795" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.613" end="42.387">面对</span><span begin="42.387" end="43.034">面</span><span begin="43.034" end="43.824">的我</span><span begin="43.824" end="44.661">们</span><span begin="44.917" end="46.069">像两个</span><span begin="46.069" end="47.062">陌生</span><span begin="47.062" end="48.795">人</span></p></div><div begin="51.326" end="1:19.781" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="51.326" end="57.136" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.326" end="52.342">零度的亲</span><span begin="52.342" end="53.356">吻</span><span begin="53.774" end="54.517">最礼</span><span begin="54.517" end="55.145">貌的</span><span begin="55.145" end="55.869">双</span><span begin="55.869" end="57.136">唇</span></p><p begin="58.116" end="1:04.687" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.116" end="59.444">感觉变</span><span begin="59.444" end="1:00.358">了</span><span begin="1:00.970" end="1:01.965">骗不了</span><span begin="1:01.965" end="1:02.919">任何</span><span begin="1:02.919" end="1:04.687">人</span></p><p begin="1:05.660" end="1:07.849" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.660" end="1:06.338">零度的</span><span begin="1:06.338" end="1:06.796">亲</span><span begin="1:06.796" end="1:07.849">吻</span></p><p begin="1:08.101" end="1:12.548" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.101" end="1:09.026">你闭上</span><span begin="1:09.026" end="1:10.057">双眼</span><span begin="1:10.057" end="1:10.544">不</span><span begin="1:10.544" end="1:11.263">让我</span><span begin="1:11.263" end="1:12.548">看透</span></p><p begin="1:12.768" end="1:19.781" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.768" end="1:13.550">我不想</span><span begin="1:13.550" end="1:14.717">追问</span><span begin="1:14.925" end="1:15.527">还能</span><span begin="1:15.527" end="1:16.657">撑</span><span begin="1:16.925" end="1:17.354">多</span><span begin="1:17.354" end="1:19.781">久</span></p></div><div begin="1:29.929" end="1:58.453" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:29.929" end="1:36.287" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.929" end="1:30.631">手</span><span begin="1:30.631" end="1:31.496">一直</span><span begin="1:31.496" end="1:33.067">牵着</span><span begin="1:33.562" end="1:34.772">心却</span><span begin="1:34.772" end="1:35.182">丢</span><span begin="1:35.182" end="1:36.287">了</span></p><p begin="1:37.192" end="1:43.869" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.192" end="1:38.566">我们在</span><span begin="1:38.566" end="1:40.401">等着</span><span begin="1:40.747" end="1:41.824">谁先</span><span begin="1:41.824" end="1:42.245">开</span><span begin="1:42.245" end="1:43.869">口</span></p><p begin="1:44.288" end="1:50.478" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.288" end="1:45.280">表面</span><span begin="1:45.280" end="1:45.545">的</span><span begin="1:45.545" end="1:47.017">笑容</span><span begin="1:47.359" end="1:48.108">让人</spa