tm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.289" end="2:21.039">我只是</span><span begin="2:21.039" end="2:21.226">不</span><span begin="2:21.226" end="2:22.431">想</span><span begin="2:22.463" end="2:22.976">追</span><span begin="2:22.976" end="2:24.322">问</span></p></div><div begin="2:28.198" end="2:41.327" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:28.198" end="2:31.717" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.198" end="2:29.238">我准备</span><span begin="2:29.238" end="2:29.702">好</span><span begin="2:29.702" end="2:30.078">接</span><span begin="2:30.078" end="2:31.717">受</span></p><p begin="2:31.908" end="2:35.200" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.908" end="2:32.774">别用亏</span><span begin="2:32.774" end="2:33.218">欠</span><span begin="2:33.218" end="2:33.763">拖</span><span begin="2:33.763" end="2:35.200">着</span></p><p begin="2:35.370" end="2:37.230" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.370" end="2:35.870">夜</span><span begin="2:35.870" end="2:36.300">太长</span><span begin="2:36.300" end="2:36.791">梦</span><span begin="2:36.791" end="2:37.230">太多</span></p><p begin="2:37.240" end="2:41.327" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.240" end="2:37.707">放</span><span begin="2:37.707" end="2:38.133">不下</span><span begin="2:38.133" end="2:38.370">为</span><span begin="2:38.370" end="2:38.852">什</span><span begin="2:38.852" end="2:41.327">么</span></p></div><div begin="2:55.862" end="3:26.613" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:55.862" end="3:01.275" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.862" end="2:56.821">亲吻</span><span begin="2:56.821" end="2:57.652">着</span><span begin="2:58.211" end="2:59.051">曾热</span><span begin="2:59.051" end="2:59.649">烈的</span><span begin="2:59.649" end="3:00.240">双</span><span begin="3:00.240" end="3:01.275">唇</span></p><p begin="3:02.482" end="3:09.434" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.482" end="3:03.708">感觉</span><span begin="3:03.708" end="3:04.978">变了</span><span begin="3:05.390" end="3: